label demo_stairs:
    scene bg_black
    athena "So you've never been inside this place?" # VA: Casual curiosity.
    medusa "Never. Rector Zeu-" # VA: Starting matter-of-fact before cutting herself off.
    pause 2.0
    medusa "Your daddy." # VA: Teasing emphasis on Daddy. She wants to see how Athena reacts to the word.
    athena "My daddy?" # VA: Immediate disbelief. 
    medusa "Forbid me from coming in." # VA: Deadpan explanation.
    athena "Please don't call him my daddy, Medusa." # VA: Polite but strained correction. One already knows how she feels about the word, and she doesn't want to hear it again.
    pause 2.0
    medusa "...But that's what he is." # VA: Unbothered logic. Medusa knows how Athena feels about the word, but she doesn't care.
    medusa "Your Daddy." # VA: Deliberate repetition to annoy Athena.
    athena "Medusa..." # VA: Warning tone, running out of patience. Ready to snap.
    medusa "You're the one who sprang out of his forehead, not me." # VA: Matter-of-fact with playful bite.
    pause 2.0
    play sound audio.athena_ugh
    athena "Okay. Forget I said anything." # VA: Defeated sigh. Athena knows she can't win this argument, and she doesn't want to waste her energy on it.
    medusa "Noted." # VA: Satisfied.
    athena "So why did my..." # VA: Trying to restart the conversation.
    medusa "Daddy?" # VA: Quick teasing interruption.
    athena "..." # VA: Silent frustration.
    athena "Esteemed, divine father..." # VA: Forced rewording through gritted teeth.
    athena "Forbid you from coming in?" # VA: Returning to the question.
    pause 2.0
    medusa "Guess." # VA: Coy challenge.
    play sound audio.athena_ugh_2
    medusa "Come on! Use that brainpower of yours." # VA: Teasing challenge. Medusa thinks Athena can just flip a switch and figure things out. 
    athena "I don't know." # VA: Flat, annoyed admission.
    athena "Because snakes and birds of prey don't mix?" # VA: Tentative reasoning.
    medusa "Exactly!" # VA: Bright, triumphant confirmation.
    athena "So it wasn't out of pettiness then." # VA: Thoughtful reassessment.
    medusa "Your daddy's WAY too soft to be petty, Athena." # VA: Playful jab with emphasis onike "WAY."
    athena "..." # VA: Internal cringe beat.
    athena "I'm going to pretend that didn't conjure up strange images of my father, Medusa." # VA: Disturbed, dry humor. Athena tries to remain formal. 
    pause 1.0
    show bg_stairs with dissolve
    show sprite_medusa_neutral_left at Position(xalign=0.5) with dissolve
    show sprite_athena_robes_neutral at Position(xalign=0.3) with dissolve
    athena "But I'm not sure why you'd think snakes and birds are going to mix now." # VA: Genuine concern, cautious.
    show sprite_medusa_happy_left at Position(xalign=0.5)
    medusa "Well, I thought if you were at my side..." # VA: Hesitant vulnerability.
    medusa "Maybe the owls wouldn't nitpick me to death." # VA: Dark humor masking anxiety.
    show sprite_athena_robes_happy at Position(xalign=0.3)
    play sound audio.athena_giggle
    athena "That won't happen, Medusa." # VA: Protective reassurance. Like a Goddess looking after  her priestess.
    athena "Not under my watch." # VA: Firm promise. 
    medusa "Promise?" # VA: Soft, seeking reassurance.
    athena "Pinky promi-" # VA: Light playful start, before being cut short.
    artemis "Fetching new luncheon meat for the owls, I see." # VA: Smug tease.
    show sprite_athena_robes_surprised at Position(xalign=0.3)
    show sprite_medusa_surprised_left at Position(xalign=0.5)
    pause 1.0
    show sprite_artemis_neutral at Position(xalign=0.7) with dissolve
    artemis "Or not." # VA: Quick, playful pivot.
    artemis "Maybe a snake sandwich is on the menu today." # VA: Sweet tone, mean intent.
    play sound audio.athena_laugh
    show sprite_medusa_angry_left at Position(xalign=0.5)
    show sprite_athena_robes_angry at Position(xalign=0.3)
    athena "Ugh, Artemis. What do you want?" # VA: Immediate irritation. Athena and Artemis have a long history of rivalry, and Athena is not in the mood for it.
    artemis "I just wanted to say hi to my favourite keeper of furballs!" # VA: Fake cheerful, mocking.
    artemis "And handler of snakes!" # VA: Strong, cruel emphasis onike "Snakes!"
    show sprite_artemis_laugh at Position(xalign=0.7)
    play sound audio.athena_laugh
    show sprite_medusa_eyebrow_left at Position(xalign=0.5)
    medusa "Hmph." # VA: Dismissive snort.
    medusa "Still not over me trashing you in paintball, huh?" # VA: Smug provocation. She wants to snark back at Artemis.
    show sprite_artemis_angry at Position(xalign=0.7)
    show sprite_athena_robes_surprised at Position(xalign=0.3)
    athena "You beat Artemis in paintball?" # VA: Genuinely surprised.
    play sound audio.artemis_grunt
    artemis "We all have our off days." # VA: Suddenly defensive, anger brimming underneath.
    show sprite_medusa_proud_left at Position(xalign=0.5)
    medusa "Sure did." # VA: Proud, smug confirmation.
    medusa "I've met town bicycles who took fewer shots to the head than Artemis did that day." # VA: Savage one-liner, delivered with a smirk.
    play sound audio.athena_angry
    show sprite_artemis_furious at Position(xalign=0.7)
    artemis "WHY YOU LITTLE-" # VA: Full on Rage - not unlike Homer Simpson when he's about to strangle Bart.
    scene bg_black with fade
    play sound audio.artemis_scream
    pause 2.0
    play sound auido.artemis_cry
    athena "TO HADES WITH YOU!" # VA: Explosive battle shout.
    pause 1.0
    play sound audio.stairs_crash
    pause 1.0
    show cg_athena_artemis_fight
    pause 2.0
    scene bg_black with fade
    show bg_stairs with fade
    show sprite_athena_robes_cringe at Position(xalign=0.3) with dissolve
    athena "Ow." # VA: Short pain reaction.
    athena "That's going to leave a mark." # VA: Wry, post-fight wince.
    show sprite_medusa_surprised at Position(xalign=0.7) with dissolve
    medusa "Wow, Athena. That was..." # VA: Awe building.
    show sprite_medusa_excited at Position(xalign=0.7) with dissolve
    medusa "AMAZING!" # VA: Full excited burst.
    show sprite_medusa_excited at Position(xalign=0.7) with dissolve
    show sprite_athena_robes_proud at Position(xalign=0.3)
    athena "I know, right?" # VA: Proud, playful confidence.
    athena "Osoto Gari is one of my signature moves." # VA: Confident, slightly showy. Athena, like fencing, is a judo fanatic.
    athena "I learned it from Amaterasu, the goddess of the sun." # VA: Informative tone, prideful at the fact she learnt under the best.
    athena "You remember her, right?" # VA: Casual question, checking Medusa's memory.
    medusa "Of course I do." # VA: Quick confirmation.
    medusa "She was the substitute PE professor for a while when..." # VA: Trail-off as her memory turns uncomfortable.
    pause 2.0
    show sprite_medusa_nervous at Position(xalign=0.7)
    athena "...When Poseidon was on leave." # VA: Careful completion, reading Medusa's mood.
    medusa "Right, Professor Poseidon." # VA: Tight, uneasy tone.
    show sprite_athena_robes_concerned at Position(xalign=0.3)
    athena "Are you alright?" # VA: Concerned and gentle.
    show sprite_medusa_neutral at Position(xalign=0.7)
    medusa "Yeah, I'm fine." # VA: Too quick, too defensive. The first time in the script where Medusa feels way out of character. 
    athena "You sure? You look a little...lightheaded." # VA: Careful concern.
    medusa "Totally fine." # VA: Forced reassurance. 
    show sprite_medusa_happy at Position(xalign=0.7)
    medusa "Come on! Let's go see your furbabies!" # VA: Bright pivot to avoid the topic.
    show sprite_athena_robes_sigh at Position(xalign=0.3)
    play sound audio.athena_sigh
    athena "You know, I've always hated that nickname." # VA: Dry exasperation.
    show sprite_medusa_confused at Position(xalign=0.7)
    medusa "What, 'furbabies'?" # VA: Innocent tease. Like Daddy, she doesn't care if this annoys Athena. 
    medusa "So you threw archery nerd down the stairs for that?" # VA: Mock-serious accusation.
    medusa "Not for me?" # VA: Playful pouting. Their friendship is moving fast. 
    show sprite_athena_robes_happy at Position(xalign=0.3)
    athena "Yes. We're not quite there friendship-wise yet." # VA: Teasing honesty.
    athena "But eventually you might do something dumb enough for me to protect you." # VA: Dry, affectionate sarcasm. Even Athena can be sarcastic at times. 
    show sprite_medusa_happy at Position(xalign=0.7)
    medusa "Glad to hear that." # VA: Warm, amused.
    play sound audio.athena_giggle
    athena "Anyway, let's go see the owls." # VA: Light, forward-moving comment.
    scene bg_black with fade
    play sound audio.footsteps
    pause 2.0
    return